Just to be clear. Currently devtools is not available for R 2.15.3 nor for R 2.14.2; it requires R 3.0. That's why Winston's instructions are to the old version of devtools, which does not depend on R 3.0.

Sorry that httpuv is not available for 2.14. It depends on Rcpp which requires R 2.15. httpuv is a critical component of Shiny: it is the webserver that serves up your application.

