You could use something like this. It is modeled after includeMarkdown in Shiny. You can now use code chunks in your Rmd file and include it in your UI. This is untested.

includeRmd <- function(path){
  if (!require(knitr))
    stop("knitr package is not installed")
  if (!require(markdown))
    stop("Markdown package is not installed")
  shiny:::dependsOnFile(path)
  html <- knitr::knit2html(path, fragment.only = TRUE)
  Encoding(html) <- 'UTF-8'
  return(HTML(html))
}

Best,
Ramnath

