Shiny Server is only for Linux for the moment, but we will likely support Windows in the coming months.

Shiny is probably not the way you want to integrate R into ASP.NET <http://ASP.NET> (assuming you just want to use R as a calculation engine). You might consider R (D)COM <http://cran.r-project.org/contrib/extra/dcom/00ReadMe.html> or R.NET <http://rdotnet.codeplex.com/>.

