Josh, are you running on Amazon EC2 as well? In the EC2 console, you want to modify the Security Group that the instance belongs to, by adding a "Custom TCP" rule for port range "3838" and source "0.0.0.0/0 <http://0.0.0.0/0>". Be sure to Add Rule and then Apply Rule Change, that should do it.

